// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1773803619" "Leonard P. Conway, aka AkashiKnight, once worked here. It kind of makes you reflect on your own life as a Hero."

